# ================================================================
# KILLER SELF-INTELLIGENCE GAUNTLET v1.0
# ================================================================
#
# THE HARDEST AI TEST IN KILLER HISTORY
#
# Tests FIVE dimensions of true independent intelligence:
#
#  1. SELF-KNOWLEDGE     — Does the AI know what KIND of thinking
#                          each problem requires before solving it?
#
#  2. MULTI-STEP CHAINS  — Can it decompose complex novel problems
#                          into sub-steps autonomously?
#
#  3. PARALLEL THOUGHT   — Ghost-108: 18 agents fire simultaneously.
#                          True concurrent intelligence, not sequential.
#
#  4. WORLD KNOWLEDGE    — Hard live-world questions no pretrained
#                          model could answer without real-time search.
#
#  5. META-COGNITION     — Does it know what it CAN and CANNOT answer?
#                          Can it rate its own confidence?
#
# NO LLM MODEL REQUIRED — runs 100% on Killer native intelligence.
# ================================================================

print("")
print("╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗")
print("║   KILLER SELF-INTELLIGENCE GAUNTLET v1.0                ║")
